## How to use the library

The library is available on [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/react-native-web-view-emotion) and can be installed with:

```bash
npm install react-native-web-view-emotion
```

### Basic usage

```jsx
import React from 'react';
import { View } from 'react-native';
import WebViewEmotion from 'react-native-web-view-emotion';

const App = () => (
  <View style={{ flex: 1 }}>
    <WebViewEmotion
      source={{ uri: 'https://www.google.com' }}
      style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}
    />
  </View>
);
```

